      "updated": 1795508682863,
      "created": 1795508474606,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "URL Shortener\nBit.ly is an URL shortening service that converts long URLs into shorter,\nmanageable links",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "URL Shortener\nBit.ly is an URL shortening service that converts long URLs into shorter, manageable links",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2XEWcGJr--lOX60Coe9Re",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 473.2421875,
      "y": 364.25,
      "width": 603.0595703125,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1281766823,
      "version": 383,
      "versionNonce": 761609319,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795508958339,
      "created": 1795508687176,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1/ Functional Requirements (Core): \n- User can create a short url from a long url\n    - Optionally support custom alias\n    - Optionally support an expiration time\n- User can be redirected to the original url from the short url",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1/ Functional Requirements (Core): \n- User can create a short url from a long url\n    - Optionally support custom alias\n    - Optionally support an expiration time\n- User can be redirected to the original url from the short url",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "P3UZoW-qbEIpuhiUUlesI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 476,
      "y": 527.3017599986467,
      "width": 557.4796142578125,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1077289415,
      "version": 626,
      "versionNonce": 67690375,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795513732528,
      "created": 1795508961242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2/ Non-functional Requirements (Quality):\n- Low latency on redirects (~200ms)\n- Scale to support 100M DAU and 1B urls\n- Ensure uniqueness of short code\n- High availability, eventual consistency for url shortening\n\n3/ Core Entities\n- Original url\n- Short url\n- User\n\n4/ API\n// shorten a URL\nPOST /urls -> shortUrl\n{\n    originalURL,\n    alias?,\n    expirationTime?\n}\n\n// redirection\nGET {shortUrl} -> Redirect to OriginalUrl",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2/ Non-functional Requirements (Quality):\n- Low latency on redirects (~200ms)\n- Scale to support 100M DAU and 1B urls\n- Ensure uniqueness of short code\n- High availability, eventual consistency for url shortening\n\n3/ Core Entities\n- Original url\n- Short url\n- User\n\n4/ API\n// shorten a URL\nPOST /urls -> shortUrl\n{\n    originalURL,\n    alias?,\n    expirationTime?\n}\n\n// redirection\nGET {shortUrl} -> Redirect to OriginalUrl",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
