    {
      "id": "JBJQLXOdwpuUCE-ZpEeP9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1198.7656338731242,
      "y": 849.6069763874876,
      "width": 519.7596435546875,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 558634697,
      "version": 1337,
      "versionNonce": 800085063,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795515105602,
      "created": 1795512687861,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Ensure uniqueness of short code\n- fast\n- unique\n- short (5-7 chars)\n\n1. prefix of the long url (bad)\n2. random number generator (mod) 10^9 char at least\n    - base62 encoding\n    - 62^6 possible combination = 56B\n    - collision resolution?\n        - just need to check for collision\n3. Hash the long url?\n    - md5(longUrl) -> hash -> base62(hash)[:6]\n    - 62^6 possible combination = 56B\n4. Counter\n    - incrementing a counter -> base62(num)\n    - no need to check DB\n    - predictability which is bad for securty\n        - \"warning, do not shorten private urls\"\n        - rate limiting\n\n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ensure uniqueness of short code\n- fast\n- unique\n- short (5-7 chars)\n\n1. prefix of the long url (bad)\n2. random number generator (mod) 10^9 char at least\n    - base62 encoding\n    - 62^6 possible combination = 56B\n    - collision resolution?\n        - just need to check for collision\n3. Hash the long url?\n    - md5(longUrl) -> hash -> base62(hash)[:6]\n    - 62^6 possible combination = 56B\n4. Counter\n    - incrementing a counter -> base62(num)\n    - no need to check DB\n    - predictability which is bad for securty\n        - \"warning, do not shorten private urls\"\n        - rate limiting\n\n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
