    {
      "id": "Qv4gOpY5COWGMsIZNbf_A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1825.4939702759502,
      "y": 842.1896587371707,
      "width": 907.6932994913326,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 461511785,
      "version": 993,
      "versionNonce": 116301319,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795515712221,
      "created": 1795514891009,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scale to support 100M DAU and 1B urls\n- 100M (10^8) request / 10^5 users = 10^3 (1000 request per sec) * (10k-100k rps peak)\n- Vertical scaling (more CPU)\n- Horizontal scaling\n    - A lot of read (redirect) but few write (create)\n\n- Scale DB\n    - Storage = short code (8) + long url (100) + creation time (8) + optional url (100) +\nexpiration (8) = 500 bytes * 1B rows = 500 GB (not a lot). Thus single instance is ok!\n    - Read throughput -> Ok since we have Redis to helpout",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scale to support 100M DAU and 1B urls\n- 100M (10^8) request / 10^5 users = 10^3 (1000 request per sec) * (10k-100k rps peak)\n- Vertical scaling (more CPU)\n- Horizontal scaling\n    - A lot of read (redirect) but few write (create)\n\n- Scale DB\n    - Storage = short code (8) + long url (100) + creation time (8) + optional url (100) + expiration (8) = 500 bytes * 1B rows = 500 GB (not a lot). Thus single instance is ok!\n    - Read throughput -> Ok since we have Redis to helpout",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rsfTlsGw7y5coahXOBirJ",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1882.4073782270239,
